msgid "Invocation"
msgstr "调用方式"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:28
msgid ""
"The command line has no daemon of its own: most commands send a request "
"to the control plane of the daemon that serves the selected identity. The"
" commands ``version``, ``help``, ``init``, ``doctor``, ``logs``, "
"``update``, ``agents``, ``verify``, ``audit`` and ``retention`` read the "
"data directory or need no daemon at all and also work while the daemon is"
" stopped. A command that needs the daemon reports ``daemon_not_running`` "
"and the command to start it when the daemon is not running."
msgstr ""
"命令行本身没有守护进程：多数命令向为所选身份服务的守护进程的控制平面发送请求。命令 ``version``\\ 、\\ ``help``\\ "
"、\\ ``init``\\ 、\\ ``doctor``\\ 、\\ ``logs``\\ 、\\ ``update``\\ 、\\ "
"``agents``\\ 、\\ ``verify``\\ 、\\ ``audit`` 和 ``retention`` "
"读取数据目录，或完全不需要守护进程，因此在守护进程停止时也可使用。需要守护进程的命令在守护进程未运行时报告 "
"``daemon_not_running``，并给出启动它的命令。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:36
msgid ""
"Running ``anet`` with no arguments prints a short guide that depends on "
"the state of the node, and names the next command to run."
msgstr "不带参数运行 ``anet`` 会输出一份简短的指引，内容取决于节点的状态，并指出下一条应执行的命令。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:40
msgid "Identity and data directory"
msgstr "身份与数据目录"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:42
msgid ""
"A machine can hold several identities. The identity named ``default`` has"
" the *home* directory itself as its data directory. Every other identity "
"has its own directory under ``<home>/ids/<name>``. The home directory is "
"the value of the environment variable ``ANET_HOME``, or ``~/.anet`` when "
"the variable is not set. Identity names match "
"``[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]*``, have at most 64 characters, and the name "
"``ids`` is reserved."
msgstr ""
"一台机器可以持有多个身份。名为 ``default`` 的身份以 *home* 目录本身作为数据目录。其他每个身份在 "
"``<home>/ids/<name>`` 下有自己的目录。home 目录取环境变量 ``ANET_HOME`` 的值；未设置该变量时为 "
"``~/.anet``\\ 。身份名称匹配 ``[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]*``，最长 64 个字符，名称 ``ids``"
" 为保留名称。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:49
msgid ""
"``--id <name>``, placed before the command, selects the identity for one "
"command. The environment variable ``ANET_ID`` has the same effect. "
"Without either, ``anet id use <name>`` decides which identity is the "
"default. ``ANET_DATA_DIR`` names one raw data directory outside this "
"layout; it is meant for tests and scripts."
msgstr ""
"置于命令之前的 ``--id <name>`` 为单条命令选择身份。环境变量 ``ANET_ID`` 的效果相同。两者都未给出时，由 ``anet"
" id use <name>`` 决定默认身份。\\ ``ANET_DATA_DIR`` 指定此布局之外的一个原始数据目录，供测试和脚本使用。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:56
msgid "Arguments of the form ``<aid>``"
msgstr "形如 ``<aid>`` 的参数"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:58
msgid ""
"Every ``<aid>`` argument accepts the complete AID only. A short form, a "
"prefix or a name is refused with ``aid_invalid`` and exit status 2, "
"before the daemon is contacted. Tables printed by ``anet find`` and "
"``anet card`` show complete AIDs, so that a value can be copied from one "
"command to the next."
msgstr ""
"每个 ``<aid>`` 参数只接受完整的 AID。简写、前缀或名称会在联系守护进程之前被拒绝，原因码为 "
"``aid_invalid``，退出状态为 2。\\ ``anet find`` 和 ``anet card`` 输出的表格显示完整的 "
"AID，以便把值从一条命令复制到下一条命令。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:64
msgid "Output"
msgstr "输出"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:66
msgid "Two kinds of command exist."
msgstr "命令分为两类。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:68
msgid ""
"Commands for people print readable text by default, and most of them "
"print JSON with ``--json``: ``init``, ``status``, ``doctor``, ``audit``, "
"``retention``, ``find``, ``card``, ``identity`` subcommands, ``peers "
"list``, ``preview`` and ``autoreply show``. ``up``, ``help``, "
"``version``, ``logs`` and ``update`` print readable text only."
msgstr ""
"面向人的命令默认输出可读文本，其中大多数加 ``--json`` 时输出 "
"JSON：``init``、``status``、``doctor``、``audit``、``retention``、``find``、``card``、``identity``"
" 的子命令、``peers list``、``preview`` 与 ``autoreply "
"show``。``up``、``help``、``version``、``logs`` 与 ``update`` 只输出可读文本。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:73
msgid ""
"The remaining commands, among them every task command (``delegate``, "
"``message``, ``task get``, ``task list``, ``task cancel``, ``end``, "
"``inbox``, ``thread`` and ``results``) and the payment and hub commands "
"(``hub-register``, ``pay``, ``payments``, ``balance``, ``redeem``, "
"``reconcile``, ``audit-hub`` and ``review``), write the JSON answer of "
"the control plane to standard output and the readable lines to standard "
"error. A pipe therefore carries clean JSON."
msgstr ""
"其余命令，包括所有任务命令（``delegate``、``message``、``task get``、``task list``、``task "
"cancel``、``end``、``inbox``、``thread`` 与 ``results``）以及付款和 hub 命令（``hub-"
"register``、``pay``、``payments``、``balance``、``redeem``、``reconcile"
"``、``audit-hub`` 与 ``review``），把控制接口的 JSON 答复写到标准输出，把可读的行写到标准错误。因此管道里是干净的"
" JSON。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:80
msgid ""
"After the JSON of a task command, at most five labelled lines follow on "
"standard error, in this order, and only those that have a value: "
"``reason``, ``delivery``, ``payment``, ``kept`` and ``note``. When the "
"sentence has a next step, a last line begins with an arrow and holds the "
"command to run:"
msgstr ""
"任务命令的 JSON 之后，标准错误上最多再跟五个带标签的行，按以下顺序，且只输出有值的行：``reason``\\ 、\\ "
"``delivery``\\ 、\\ ``payment``\\ 、\\ ``kept`` 和 ``note``\\ "
"。语句带有下一步时，最后一行以箭头开头，给出应执行的命令："

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:91
msgid ""
"When the control plane refuses a request, the command prints only the "
"``error`` sentence, followed by its reason code in brackets, and, if "
"present, the ``next`` line, both on standard error, and exits with status"
" 1. It does not print the JSON body. For example, ``... send it again in "
"2 minutes. [busy]``. A refusal that the hub returned with a code of its "
"own shows ``[hub_refused:<hub code>]``. See :ref:`reason-codes-shown`."
msgstr ""
"控制平面拒绝请求时，命令只在标准错误上输出 ``error`` 语句，其后用方括号给出原因码，若有 ``next`` 则再输出该行，并以状态 1 "
"退出，不输出 JSON 正文。例如 ``... send it again in 2 minutes. [busy]``。hub "
"以自己的代码返回的拒绝显示为 ``[hub_refused:<hub code>]``。见 :ref:`reason-codes-shown`。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:99
msgid "Language"
msgstr "语言"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:101
msgid ""
"Sentences are rendered in English. The environment variable ``ANET_LANG``"
" selects Chinese when its value begins with ``zh``, in any letter case, "
"for example ``zh``, ``zh-CN`` or ``zh_CN.UTF-8``; any other value, or no "
"value, selects English. ``LC_ALL``, ``LC_MESSAGES`` and ``LANG`` are not "
"consulted. Text that anet hands to a model, such as the egress refusals "
"read by a sandboxed agent, is English in both languages. The invocation "
"column of ``anet help`` is the same in both languages, so that a command "
"copied from one language works in the other. See :doc:`reason-codes`."
msgstr ""
"语句默认以英文生成。环境变量 ``ANET_LANG`` 的值以 ``zh`` 开头（不区分大小写，例如 ``zh``、``zh-CN`` 或 "
"``zh_CN.UTF-8``）时选择中文；其他值或未设置时选择英文。``LC_ALL``、``LC_MESSAGES`` 和 ``LANG`` "
"不再参与判断。anet 交给模型的文本，例如沙箱中的 agent 所读取的出站拒绝语句，在两种语言下均为英文。\\ ``anet help`` "
"的调用列在两种语言中相同，因此从一种语言复制的命令在另一种语言中同样有效。参见 :doc:`reason-codes`\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:113
msgid "Exit status"
msgstr "退出状态"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:119
msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:120
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:121
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:122
msgid ""
"The command completed. This includes outcomes that finish on their own: "
"``hub_pending_admission``, ``hub_retrying``, ``old_hub_unacked``, a key "
"event that is stored while publication is still running "
"(``rotation_pending``), and a join without a terminal that leaves the "
"recovery passphrase unset (the output carries ``identity.unprotected``)."
msgstr ""
"命令已完成。这包括会自行完成的结果：``hub_pending_admission``\\ 、\\ ``hub_retrying``\\ 、\\ "
"``old_hub_unacked``\\ "
"、在发布仍在进行时已存储的密钥事件（``rotation_pending``），以及在没有终端的情况下加入 hub 且未设置恢复口令（输出带有 "
"``identity.unprotected``）。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:127
msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:128
msgid ""
"The request was refused or failed: a non-2xx answer of the control plane,"
" ``hub_refused``, ``hub_unreachable``, a refusal because an earlier "
"publication is still pending, or a terminal confirmation that was not "
"answered with ``yes``."
msgstr ""
"请求被拒绝或失败：控制平面返回非 2xx 应答、\\ ``hub_refused``\\ 、\\ ``hub_unreachable``\\ "
"、因先前的发布仍未完成而被拒绝，或终端确认未以 ``yes`` 作答。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:132
msgid "2"
msgstr "2"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:133
msgid ""
"Usage error, use of a removed command or flag (``cli_removed``, "
"``api_key_on_argv``), an ``<aid>`` argument that is not a complete AID, "
"or a command whose module is not part of the build (``module_absent``)."
msgstr ""
"用法错误、使用了已移除的命令或标志（``cli_removed``、``api_key_on_argv``）、``<aid>`` 参数不是完整的 "
"AID，或命令所属的模块不在构建中（``module_absent``）。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:136
msgid "3"
msgstr "3"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:137
msgid ""
"Only for ``task watch`` and ``delegate --watch``: the task stopped in "
"``input-required`` and needs a payment or an answer."
msgstr "仅用于 ``task watch`` 和 ``delegate --watch``：任务停在 ``input-required``，需要支付或答复。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:140
msgid ""
"``task watch`` and ``delegate --watch`` exit with status 0 when the task "
"is ``completed`` and with status 1 when it is ``failed``, ``rejected`` or"
" ``canceled``."
msgstr ""
"任务为 ``completed`` 时，``task watch`` 和 ``delegate --watch`` 以状态 0 退出；任务为 "
"``failed``\\ 、\\ ``rejected`` 或 ``canceled`` 时，以状态 1 退出。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:145
msgid "Confirmation on the terminal"
msgstr "在终端上确认"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:147
msgid ""
"An operation that widens what the node exposes, spends credits or changes"
" an identity is confirmed on the terminal of the operator. This covers "
"``peers allow`` and ``peers trust``, ``inbound policy`` when it is "
"loosened, ``inbound approve``, ``payments set``, ``payees add``, ``pay``,"
" ``redeem``, ``retention set``, every ``identity`` operation that changes"
" keys, and the settings of ``autoreply`` and ``preview`` that expose "
"more. Without a terminal (for example when a coding agent runs the "
"command) the command refuses with ``tty_required`` and prints the command"
" to run in a terminal. The MCP tools do not change any configuration."
msgstr ""
"扩大节点对外暴露的范围、花费 credits 或更改身份的操作，需要在运营人员的终端上确认。这包括 ``peers allow`` 和 "
"``peers trust``\\ 、放宽时的 ``inbound policy``\\ 、\\ ``inbound approve``\\ "
"、\\ ``payments set``\\ 、\\ ``payees add``\\ 、\\ ``pay``\\ 、\\ "
"``redeem``\\ 、\\ ``retention set``\\ 、所有更改密钥的 ``identity`` 操作，以及 "
"``autoreply`` 和 ``preview`` 中会暴露更多内容的设置。没有终端时（例如由编程 agent 运行该命令），命令以 "
"``tty_required`` 拒绝，并输出应在终端中运行的命令。MCP 工具不会更改任何配置。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:159
msgid "Command index"
msgstr "命令索引"

