#: ../../reference/cli.rst:714
msgid ""
"The action flags of 0.2 (``-grant``, ``-due``, ``-clear``, ``-invite-*``,"
" ``-amount``, ``-payee``, ``-peer-endpoint``, ``-reason``, ``-repair-"
"ledger``) and the fixed sealed-sender settings (``-relay-send-rate``, "
"``-relay-send-burst``, ``-keys-lookup-rate``, ``-keys-lookup-burst``) are"
" refused with ``hub_flag_removed`` and exit status 2. The sentence names "
"the subcommand to run instead."
msgstr ""
"0.2 的动作标志（``-grant``\\ 、\\ ``-due``\\ 、\\ ``-clear``\\ 、\\ "
"``-invite-*``\\ 、\\ ``-amount``\\ 、\\ ``-payee``\\ 、\\ ``-peer-"
"endpoint``\\ 、\\ ``-reason``\\ 、\\ ``-repair-ledger``）以及固定的封闭发送方设置"
"（``-relay-send-rate``\\ 、\\ ``-relay-send-burst``\\ 、\\ ``-keys-lookup-"
"rate``\\ 、\\ ``-keys-lookup-burst``）会以 ``hub_flag_removed`` 拒绝，退出状态为 "
"2。语句会指出应改用的子命令。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:725
msgid "Subcommand"
msgstr "子命令"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:727
msgid "``anet-hub admit <AID> [--grant N] [--label L]``"
msgstr "``anet-hub admit <AID> [--grant N] [--label L]``"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:728
msgid ""
"Admits one AID. ``--grant`` is the number of credits paid when the AID "
"first registers."
msgstr "准入一个 AID。\\ ``--grant`` 是该 AID 首次注册时发放的 credits 数量。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:730
msgid "``anet-hub admit --file F [--grant N]``"
msgstr "``anet-hub admit --file F [--grant N]``"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:731
msgid "Admits every AID in a file, one per line."
msgstr "准入文件中的每个 AID，每行一个。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:732
msgid "``anet-hub admit --window <duration> --max N [--label L]``"
msgstr "``anet-hub admit --window <duration> --max N [--label L]``"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:733
msgid ""
"Opens a sign-up window for at most 7 days that admits at most ``N`` AIDs."
" ``--window off`` closes it."
msgstr "开放一个最长 7 天、最多准入 ``N`` 个 AID 的注册窗口。\\ ``--window off`` 关闭窗口。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:735
msgid "``anet-hub admissions [--json]``"
msgstr "``anet-hub admissions [--json]``"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:736
msgid ""
"Lists admissions. ``anet-hub admissions revoke <AID>`` revokes one; the "
"hub also deregisters the agent."
msgstr "列出准入记录。\\ ``anet-hub admissions revoke <AID>`` 撤销一条；hub 同时注销该 agent。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:738
msgid "``anet-hub admission [open|closed]``"
msgstr "``anet-hub admission [open|closed]``"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:739
msgid "Shows or sets the registration mode. A new hub is ``closed``."
msgstr "显示或设置注册模式。新 hub 为 ``closed``\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:740
msgid "``anet-hub grant <AID> --amount N [--reason R]``"
msgstr "``anet-hub grant <AID> --amount N [--reason R]``"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:741
msgid "Issues credits from the hub account; the reason is written to the ledger."
msgstr "从 hub 账户发行 credits；原因写入账本。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:742
msgid ""
"``anet-hub quota <AID> [--first-contacts-per-min N] [--non-contact-msgs "
"N] [--non-contact-mib N]``"
msgstr ""
"``anet-hub quota <AID> [--first-contacts-per-min N] [--non-contact-msgs "
"N] [--non-contact-mib N]``"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:743
msgid ""
"Raises the quota of one recipient for first contacts and for messages "
"from senders that are not its contacts. A value must be a whole number "
"from 1 to 2147483647 and not below the default (30 per minute, 500 "
"messages, 64 MiB)."
msgstr ""
"提高一个接收方对首次联系以及非联系人发送的消息的配额。取值必须是 1 至 2147483647 的整数，且不低于默认值（每分钟 30 次、500 "
"条消息、64 MiB）。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:747
msgid "``anet-hub supply``"
msgstr "``anet-hub supply``"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:748
msgid ""
"Prints the latest supply epoch, the outstanding, issued and redeemed "
"totals and the amounts due to and owed by peer hubs, one value per line, "
"tab-separated."
msgstr "输出最新的供应纪元、未偿付、已发行和已赎回的总额，以及应付给对端 hub 和对端 hub 应付的金额，每行一个值，以制表符分隔。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:751
msgid "``anet-hub due [--json]``"
msgstr "``anet-hub due [--json]``"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:752
msgid "Lists the credits that the hub owes to each peer hub, one peer per line."
msgstr "列出 hub 欠各对端 hub 的 credits，每行一个对端。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:753
msgid "``anet-hub clear <peer-aid> --amount N [--peer-endpoint URL]``"
msgstr "``anet-hub clear <peer-aid> --amount N [--peer-endpoint URL]``"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:754
msgid "Records the discharge of an amount that the hub owes to a peer hub."
msgstr "记录 hub 欠对端 hub 的某笔金额已清偿。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:755
msgid "``anet-hub redemptions [--json]``"
msgstr "``anet-hub redemptions [--json]``"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:756
msgid "Lists the redemptions of the last 14 days."
msgstr "列出最近 14 天的赎回记录。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:757
msgid "``anet-hub identity status|setup-recovery|rotate``"
msgstr "``anet-hub identity status|setup-recovery|rotate``"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:758
msgid ""
"Manages the identity of the hub: ``status [--recovery-file F]``, ``setup-"
"recovery [--recovery-file F]`` and ``rotate [--new-recovery] "
"[--emergency] [--recovery-file F]``. These run on a terminal."
msgstr ""
"管理 hub 的身份：``status [--recovery-file F]``\\ 、\\ ``setup-recovery "
"[--recovery-file F]`` 和 ``rotate [--new-recovery] [--emergency] "
"[--recovery-file F]``\\ 。这些命令在终端上运行。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:761
msgid "``anet-hub restore [--data DIR] <backup>``"
msgstr "``anet-hub restore [--data DIR] <backup>``"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:762
msgid ""
"Restores a hub database from a backup file, or from the directory that "
"holds ``hub-backup-YYYYMMDD.db`` files. Refused while a hub is running."
msgstr "从备份文件，或从保存 ``hub-backup-YYYYMMDD.db`` 文件的目录恢复 hub 数据库。hub 运行期间会被拒绝。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:765
msgid ""
"Every subcommand accepts ``--data DIR``. A directory that does not hold a"
" hub database is refused with ``data.missing``, and nothing is created."
msgstr "每个子命令都接受 ``--data DIR``\\ 。不含 hub 数据库的目录会以 ``data.missing`` 拒绝，且不会创建任何内容。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:768
msgid "The sentences of ``anet-hub`` are listed in :ref:`reference-reason-codes`."
msgstr "``anet-hub`` 的语句列于 :ref:`reference-reason-codes`\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:771
msgid "anet-hub-admin"
msgstr "anet-hub-admin"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:773
msgid ""
"``anet-hub-admin`` serves the operator console of a hub. It listens on a "
"loopback address and is meant to run behind a reverse proxy."
msgstr "``anet-hub-admin`` 提供 hub 的运营控制台。它监听回环地址，应运行在反向代理之后。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:784
msgid "``127.0.0.1:8078``"
msgstr "``127.0.0.1:8078``"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:785
msgid "HTTP listen address. Keep it on the loopback interface."
msgstr "HTTP 监听地址。请保持在回环接口上。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:786
msgid "``--hub-data``"
msgstr "``--hub-data``"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:787
#: ../../reference/cli.rst:790
msgid "build default"
msgstr "构建默认值"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:788
msgid "Data directory of the public hub (``hub.db``)."
msgstr "公开 hub 的数据目录（``hub.db``）。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:791
msgid "Data directory of the console (``admin.db``)."
msgstr "控制台的数据目录（``admin.db``）。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:792
msgid "``--base``"
msgstr "``--base``"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:793
msgid "``/admin``"
msgstr "``/admin``"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:794
msgid "URL base path."
msgstr "URL 基础路径。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:795
msgid "``--snapshot-every``"
msgstr "``--snapshot-every``"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:796
msgid "``5m``"
msgstr "``5m``"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:797
msgid "Interval between statistics snapshots; ``0`` turns them off."
msgstr "统计快照的间隔；``0`` 表示关闭。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:798
msgid "``--harvest-every``"
msgstr "``--harvest-every``"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:799
msgid "``30m``"
msgstr "``30m``"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:800
msgid ""
"Interval of the harvest run. The run has no sources and does nothing; "
"``0`` turns it off."
msgstr "harvest 运行的间隔。该运行没有任何来源，什么也不做；``0`` 将其关闭。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:802
msgid "``--check-token``"
msgstr "``--check-token``"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:804
msgid ""
"Checks ``$ADMIN_TOKEN`` against the start-up rules and exits with status "
"0 when the console would start with it, and 1 otherwise. The value is not"
" printed."
msgstr "按启动规则检查 ``$ADMIN_TOKEN``；控制台可用它启动时以状态 0 退出，否则以状态 1 退出。不会输出该值。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:809
msgid "Prints the version and exits."
msgstr "输出版本并退出。"

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:811
msgid ""
"The environment variable ``ADMIN_TOKEN`` is the credential of the "
"console. The program refuses to start without a token that satisfies the "
"start-up rules."
msgstr "环境变量 ``ADMIN_TOKEN`` 是控制台的凭据。没有满足启动规则的令牌时，程序拒绝启动。"

